{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "name": "kedama",
  "homepage": "https://kedama-design.github.io/KedamaDesignSystem/",
  "items": [
    {
      "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
      "name": "app-shell",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "AppShell",
      "description": "アプリケーションの外枠一式。AppShell / AuthShell / AppTitleBar / SidebarNav / IconRail / AppHeader / StatusBar / RightPane を1つのアイテムとして配る。Tier 0 は npm の @kedama-design/design-system から取る。",
      "dependencies": ["@kedama-design/design-system", "lucide-react"],
      "docs": "Tier 0 を先に入れておくこと（@kedama-design/design-system は private な GitHub Packages。.npmrc と read:packages が要る）。AppShell は認証後の画面にだけ着せ、ログインなど認証前の画面には AuthShell を使う。",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/AppShell.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/AppShell.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/AuthShell.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/AuthShell.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/AppTitleBar.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/AppTitleBar.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/SidebarNav.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/SidebarNav.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/IconRail.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/IconRail.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/AppHeader.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/AppHeader.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/StatusBar.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/StatusBar.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/RightPane.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/RightPane.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/useIsMobile.ts",
          "type": "registry:hook",
          "target": "components/app-shell/useIsMobile.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/app-shell/index.ts",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/app-shell/index.ts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
      "name": "data-table",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "DataTable",
      "description": "TanStack Table v8を中核にした業務一覧。行選択・列フィルタ・ソート・列表示制御・loading / empty / error・任意ページングを提供する。フィルタとソートは保存ビューから外部制御できる。",
      "dependencies": ["@kedama-design/design-system", "@tanstack/react-table@8.21.3"],
      "docs": "列はIDで定義し、位置で値を参照しない。列表示は設定画面からcolumnVisibilityで制御し、フィルタはDataTableColumnHeaderから列ごとに行う。columnFilters / sortingを外部制御すると、AppHeaderのタブなどプロダクト側の保存ビューと接続できる。selectableで先頭に選択列を追加し、onSelectedRowsChangeで元データを一括操作へ渡せる。",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/data-table/DataTable.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/data-table/DataTable.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/data-table/index.ts",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/data-table/index.ts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
      "name": "command-palette",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "CommandPalette",
      "description": "cmdkを中核にした横断検索とクイック操作。安定したcommand ID、グループ、keywords、disabled、Cmd/Ctrl+K、制御・非制御の開閉を提供する。",
      "dependencies": ["@kedama-design/design-system", "cmdk@1.1.1"],
      "docs": "CommandPaletteは補助入口であり、主要操作をここだけに隠さない。外部のinput / textarea / select / contenteditableではCmd/Ctrl+Kを横取りしない。shortcutKey={null}でグローバルキーを無効化できる。",
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/command-palette/CommandPalette.tsx",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/command-palette/CommandPalette.tsx"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/blocks/command-palette/index.ts",
          "type": "registry:component",
          "target": "components/command-palette/index.ts"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
